#: ../../tools/ena_browser_tools.rst:32 63aabe46d4194b4690c336a5f1636a35
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get entry information from ENA by accession number. "
"Supports EMBL/GenBank accessions only (e.g., U00096, AJ312385, M15390). "
"Does NOT support RefSeq accessions (NC\\_\\*, NM\\_\\*, NP\\_\\* "
"prefixes). Currently extracts metadata from FASTA header. For "
"comprehensive metadata including project, sample, taxon, publications, "
"and sequence length, use ena\\_get\\_entry\\_summary instead. Returns "
"sequence header information with basic metadata."
msgstr ""

